    <item>
      <title>Kasper 1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 22:09:45 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>14</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>New optional Full Disk Access step in setup and in Settings, Permissions, with a button that opens the right page in System Settings.</li><li>When macOS blocks Kasper from a protected folder, Kasper now tells you and opens Full Disk Access settings instead of failing quietly.</li></ul>]]></description>
