    <item>
      <title>Kasper 1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 22:03:56 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Fixes &quot;empty the Trash&quot; being skipped and Kasper saying the Trash was empty when it wasn&#x27;t.</li><li>Kasper&#x27;s reply and result cards now use the same glass as agent cards and are narrower.</li><li>Kasper only listens while you hold Command Esc. It no longer keeps listening on its own after answering.</li></ul>]]></description>
