    <item>
      <title>Kasper 1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 21:42:12 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>11</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Fixes Allow Contacts and Allow Calendar and Reminders doing nothing. If access was turned off before, Kasper now opens the right page in System Settings.</li><li>The sign-in screen links to the Terms and Privacy Policy.</li></ul>]]></description>
