    <item>
      <title>Kasper 1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 13:06:27 +0200</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>10</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>Integrations like Notion, Slack, GitHub and Google are marked as coming soon while they are being set up.</li><li>Kasper now checks for updates when it starts and every hour, so fixes reach you sooner.</li></ul>]]></description>
