      <sparkle:version>9</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>26.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>First public release of Kasper for macOS.</li><li>Hold ⌘ Esc and speak: Kasper answers, does things on your Mac, or shows you where to click.</li><li>Sign in with Google, then connect your ChatGPT Plus or Pro plan or an OpenAI API key. Kasper itself is free.</li><li>Kasper now updates itself automatically.</li></ul>]]></description>
